WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.481 --> 00:00:02.731
(groaning)

00:00:03.608 --> 00:00:05.183
- It tastes like cold barf.

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:08.850
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:09.959 --> 00:00:11.709
I love juicy buffalo wings.

00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:13.802
I could dip my fries in the sauce.

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:14.823
It's delicious.

00:00:14.823 --> 00:00:17.528
- I love buffalo sauce on
pretty much everything.

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:18.534
- I don't think there are many people

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:19.535
who don't like buffalo chicken.

00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:22.613
- I'm not really a big buffalo
chicken guy in general.

00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:24.364
I know a lot of people would be ashamed

00:00:24.364 --> 00:00:25.365
to hear me say that.

00:00:25.365 --> 00:00:27.850
- A milkshake is just one
of the best things on earth.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.364
- I like milkshakes, they
can be a little much.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:31.518
- Vanilla, I know it sounds plain,

00:00:31.518 --> 00:00:33.339
but like a vanilla bean milkshake,

00:00:33.339 --> 00:00:35.546
kind of plain, that's
really, that's my jam.

00:00:35.546 --> 00:00:37.021
- I like it so much that even though

00:00:37.021 --> 00:00:40.013
I'm lactose intolerant I'll
still drink a milkshake.

00:00:40.013 --> 00:00:43.680
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:50.954 --> 00:00:53.160
- It's a nice color.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.481
It's not un-appetizing.

00:00:55.481 --> 00:00:56.698
- The chicken is actually the one thing

00:00:56.698 --> 00:00:58.279
that's actually kind of
helping it a little bit

00:00:58.279 --> 00:00:59.406
because it's the one thing that looks like

00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:00.669
a normal piece of food.

00:01:00.669 --> 00:01:03.109
- The blue cheese chunks
are kind of gross looking.

00:01:03.109 --> 00:01:05.276
(gagging)

00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:09.343
- Worst thing I've tried on BuzzFeed.

00:01:09.343 --> 00:01:12.235
- The after taste is
really, it's something.

00:01:12.235 --> 00:01:16.402
- The feeling is like if
someone lugeyed in their mouth

00:01:17.575 --> 00:01:19.375
and spit it down your throat.

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:22.482
- It becomes more tolerable
as you work through it.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:23.694
It's kind of like drinking ketchup.

00:01:23.694 --> 00:01:25.038
- I feel like this could be a good base

00:01:25.038 --> 00:01:27.652
for like a Bloody Mary situation

00:01:27.652 --> 00:01:29.208
because it's already got
that like Worcestershire

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:31.391
kind of spiciness.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:35.234
I think with some vodka
and some more vodka

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.670
it would be pretty good.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:38.411
- It's inconsistent,
it's not even the same.

00:01:38.411 --> 00:01:39.678
Like you drink it and it tastes bad

00:01:39.678 --> 00:01:40.782
and then you drink another sip

00:01:40.782 --> 00:01:42.107
and it tastes bad in a different way.

00:01:42.107 --> 00:01:44.685
- It's like if you freeze
people's like sweat

00:01:44.685 --> 00:01:45.937
after the gym and then just put it

00:01:45.937 --> 00:01:48.202
and made it into a Popsicle.

00:01:48.202 --> 00:01:50.442
- Like if somebody offered me some money,

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:52.912
not a lot of money, like
a decent amount of money,

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.248
I would down like a couple of these.

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:58.402
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:58.402 --> 00:02:00.381
- It has the consistency of like diarrhea.

00:02:00.381 --> 00:02:02.464
You know, like, ugh, ugh.

00:02:03.401 --> 00:02:05.374
- It doesn't taste enough
like buffalo sauce for me.

00:02:05.374 --> 00:02:07.022
I would have really preferred it

00:02:07.022 --> 00:02:09.501
to be straight buffalo sauce.

00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:10.503
- Next time I have a milkshake,

00:02:10.503 --> 00:02:12.465
I'm definitely going to think
about this a little bit.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.127
Like I'm going to have it
and I'm going to be like,

00:02:14.127 --> 00:02:15.888
is this going to taste like blue cheese?

00:02:15.888 --> 00:02:17.617
- Chicken and milk already
sounds bad together,

00:02:17.617 --> 00:02:20.107
but it didn't even taste
bad in the way I thought

00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:21.112
it would taste.

00:02:21.112 --> 00:02:22.112
It tasted worst.

00:02:22.112 --> 00:02:23.114
It surprised me.

00:02:23.114 --> 00:02:24.621
Excuse me.

00:02:24.621 --> 00:02:27.371
See, it's already coming back up.

00:02:28.347 --> 00:02:30.430
It's already coming back.

